  "description": "Hayoon is a cosmetics influencer who shines brightly and is loved by everyone. But there’s one person in front of whom she loses that shine: another influencer, Iseo.\n\nEven at the semester kickoff party Hayoon had been looking forward to, everyone’s attention shifts to Iseo the moment she appears.\n\nCaught between admiration and jealousy, Hayoon’s feelings become increasingly complicated. But after blurting something out while drunk, she unexpectedly ends up in a new kind of relationship with Iseo…?\n\n“Then, should we date? I like you too.”\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/secret_likes)",
